## Final Instruction

**Extend the existing application; do not create a separate frontend project. Reuse the current frontend framework, internal SSC-CDT4 setup, Spring Boot backend, and Oracle configuration. Add the CDS Control Tower Dashboard as a modular new dashboard with the existing application design as its default theme and three additional soft, warm, premium themes. Inspect first, verify compatibility, and then implement incrementally without breaking existing functionality.**
